            "sid": "JON 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Likhuwa liOMWAMI nilimwitsila Yona olwakhabili, liri ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JON 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rula otsie eNinewe, litookho likhongo tsana, oliilwatsile omwilwatso okwa ekhulaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JON 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho Yona narula, natsia eNinewe, shinga OMWAMI olwa yasunga. Ne Ninewe liali litookho likhongo muno; obubambalifu bwalio bwahela oluchendo lwetsindaalo tsitaru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JON 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yona nachaaka okhwinjila mwitookho, natsia oluchendo Iweshiteere eshilamba; nachinga omunwa, nasunga mbu Tsishili tsindaalo amakhumi kane, mana Ninewe lilakwisibwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JON 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabo abandu baNinewe nibasuubila Nyasaye; nibakhupa omulome kwokhuhonga inzala, nibeefwala tsingubo tsiamakunia, okhurula khubakhongo okhuula khubatuutu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.3.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JON 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JON 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amakhuwa nikoola ewomuruchi waNinewe; naye nabuukha narula khushifumbishie shioburuchi, niyeefwalula eshiifwaloshie, niyeefwala ingubo yelikunia, niyeekhala mwikoshe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JON 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakhupa omulome, nakutswania muNinewe khulwa lilako liomuruchi nabamakurube; mbu Omundu yesi aleshe kata okhutsanzama khushindu shiosi; kata omuruko, okwomwituuli kata okwomubiayokata okhulia, kata okhunywa amatsi ta; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JON 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ne beefuunishe tsingubo tsiamakunia, abandu nemiruko, nibamuhaabila Nyasaye muno; toto, bashiukhane barule buli mundu khunjilaye imbii, nokhurula khumahababa akali mumakhono kabwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JON 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali heena ounyala okhumanya akOMWAMI, naba niyeetsa okhushiukhana niyeekalukhasia, nashiukhana okhulekha oburimabwe obululu, khuleshe okhufwa?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.3.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
